## `EmbeddedChunk`

Represents a chunk together with its embedding vector.

```ts
interface EmbeddedChunk {
  id: string;
  source: string;
  chunk: number;
  text: string;
  embedding: number[];
  embeddingModel?: string;
}
```

The `embeddingModel` property is optional.

