l generation and route execution are represented using `ChatbotError` with an appropriate error code.

For example, a provider-related failure can be represented as:

```ts
new ChatbotError("The AI provider returned an error.", "PROVIDER");
```

The error message depends on the failure that occurred.

Your client can handle these errors through the `onError` callback:

```tsx
